Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.93,0:00:09.74,Main - Italics,Tohka,0,0,0,,What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.46,0:00:12.49,Main - Italics,Tohka,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.25,0:00:15.03,Main - Italics,Tohka,0,0,0,,Where's Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.03,0:00:16.93,Main - Italics,Tohka,0,0,0,,Where's Mio Takamiya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.49,0:00:20.23,Main - Italics,Tohka,0,0,0,,Ahh, I'm sleepy...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:23.05,Main - Italics,Tohka,0,0,0,,No, I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:24.70,Main - Italics,Tohka,0,0,0,,I have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:29.19,Main - Italics,Tohka,0,0,0,,I have to hurry back to Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.73,0:00:33.33,Main,InverseTohka,0,0,0,,Will you sink?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.33,0:00:35.26,Main,InverseTohka,0,0,0,,Well, that works too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.94,0:00:37.85,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.46,0:00:39.94,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.47,0:00:41.39,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,My name?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.85,0:00:43.62,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,I have none.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.69,0:00:49.77,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,If I had to say, then I am you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.77,0:00:50.93,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.80,0:00:54.10,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,What on earth is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.79,0:00:56.26,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Is this a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.69,0:00:59.65,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,That's not correct, \Nbut it's not far off either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.39,0:01:05.66,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,The only difference is we're inside \Nthat woman, not your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.94,0:01:07.17,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,That woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.83,0:01:09.67,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,You mean Mio Takamiya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:12.24,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Where's everyone else?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.24,0:01:15.42,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,If I'm here, then shouldn't \Neveryone else be here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.43,0:01:19.01,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,You're the only one alive in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.59,0:01:25.69,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,All the others died as humans \Nwhen that woman stole their Sephirah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.37,0:01:33.26,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.26,0:01:34.69,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Died as humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.69,0:01:36.13,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.13,0:01:39.28,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I know Origami and Kotori used to be human,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:44.70,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,but Yoshino, Kaguya, Yuzuru, \Nand Natsumi are pure spirits like me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.70,0:01:46.10,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.10,0:01:49.65,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,Aside from that woman, \Nall those known as Spirits
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:53.59,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,are just humans \Nwho that woman granted Sephirah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.09,0:01:56.94,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,All of those you named just now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.94,0:02:00.21,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,simply lost their memories \Nof when they were human.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.21,0:02:00.97,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.97,0:02:04.42,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,All the Spirits used to be human?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.11,0:02:09.17,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,No, I remember Nia \Nsaying something like that, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.17,0:02:11.98,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,But if that is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:14.36,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,then why am I alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.73,0:02:16.65,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,If I was a human too,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.65,0:02:22.19,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,then I should've died as a human when my \NSephirah was stolen, just like the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.26,0:02:24.87,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.87,0:02:27.11,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,That's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:07.35,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,What I've just told you \Nis everything I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:11.34,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.27,0:04:14.54,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,I thought you would be confused,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.54,0:04:17.14,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,but you've absorbed that surprisingly fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.14,0:04:17.83,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.71,0:04:21.36,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,No, I am confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:23.90,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,But if what you say is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.90,0:04:26.13,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,then right now I'm grateful for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.46,0:04:27.20,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:30.34,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I'm still here and alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.34,0:04:33.04,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,And if I'm alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:34.46,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,then I can still fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.79,0:04:36.94,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,Your enemy is our mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:40.07,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,Even if you are able to fight, \Nyou're no match for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.07,0:04:43.34,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,The most you can do is buy \Na few minutes of time at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.83,0:04:47.73,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,Then she'll eliminate you without \Nleaving a trace of consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:49.05,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.05,0:04:53.34,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,If I buy a few minutes, \Nthen Shido might be able to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.34,0:04:57.86,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,He might be able to think of some way \Nto break free of this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:05:02.34,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,That's enough hope to risk my life for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.86,0:05:03.94,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.62,0:05:07.97,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,Though if you die,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.97,0:05:10.69,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,then that means I will perish as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:13.38,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,Since I am you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:15.45,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I-Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.45,0:05:17.62,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Well, hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.82,0:05:19.82,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:25.23,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,But you want me to fight too, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.23,0:05:26.30,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.30,0:05:27.63,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,Why do you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.92,0:05:31.76,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Because you called out to me, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.17,0:05:37.35,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,True!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.99,0:05:39.99,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,Yes, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.50,0:05:47.01,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,Then you should go, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.41,0:05:49.50,Main,Inverse,0,0,0,,Go fight to your heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:53.13,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.10,0:06:07.66,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Everyone's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.43,0:06:10.27,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.17,0:06:20.35,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.68,0:06:21.65,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.10,0:06:26.99,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I never wanted to make you sad,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.34,0:06:29.54,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,but it'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.13,0:06:32.47,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Those memories will be gone soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.07,0:06:35.37,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,This sin is mine to bear alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.78,0:06:39.31,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,So there's no need to blame yourself, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.79,0:06:41.88,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.14,0:06:49.01,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,We'll redo everything, starting from \Nthat day you were shot in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.47,0:06:51.58,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Redo everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.29,0:06:54.25,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Forgetting everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.64,0:06:56.04,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:58.02,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,As Shinji Takamiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.53,0:07:11.28,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.62,0:07:16.58,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:17.41,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,You're safe?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.11,0:07:19.04,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Tohka?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.44,0:07:23.68,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Nothing is over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.68,0:07:26.54,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Now, stand up, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.47,0:07:28.35,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Tohka!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.14,0:07:30.30,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Tohka!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.03,0:07:32.31,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Tohka...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:33.90,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.38,0:07:35.96,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,For a moment, I nearly gave up...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.96,0:07:37.29,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.29,0:07:40.56,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido, you're still alive right now \Nbecause you didn't lose hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.01,0:07:43.15,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Could there be any better result than that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.09,0:07:47.19,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tohka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.54,0:07:51.28,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Honestly, you keep saving me, Tohka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.28,0:07:53.70,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I'm always relying on you too, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.18,0:07:57.33,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Even now, I was able to return because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:08:00.70,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I'm able to stand before Mio because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.34,0:08:02.71,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Tohka...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.13,0:08:05.21,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.53,0:08:06.88,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:09.21,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,So it was you, Tohka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:11.39,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.39,0:08:14.92,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I was always sure that if \Nany would stand against me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:17.72,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,then it would be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.38,0:08:22.92,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I divided my power into ten Sephirah
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:25.73,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,and granted them to humans to create Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.38,0:08:29.05,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Though for some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.05,0:08:33.29,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,one of those ten Sephirah \Nsprouted its own consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.94,0:08:37.58,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Almost like the moment I was born, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.87,0:08:42.27,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin, you've realized it too, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.74,0:08:45.25,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,The difference between Tohka \Nand the other Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:50.06,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,The one thing the other Spirits had \Nthat Tohka didn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.53,0:08:53.53,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,A name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.53,0:08:54.26,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.02,0:08:58.51,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,All the Spirits used to be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:01.59,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,That's why they possessed \Na name from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.60,0:09:05.37,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,However, Tohka was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.37,0:09:07.18,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Only Tohka and I were.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:09.41,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I had my share of confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.82,0:09:12.99,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I had agonized over my lack of a name, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.67,0:09:17.49,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Though right now I'm grateful for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.86,0:09:22.50,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I was able to have you grant me my name \Nbecause I didn't have one of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:27.75,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,And I'm able to stand in front of you now \Nbecause I was never human!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.30,0:09:35.64,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,This is throwing off my plans a bit, \Nbut well, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:37.89,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,The result will still be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.87,0:10:07.22,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I did it, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.22,0:10:08.85,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,My attack went through!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.85,0:10:09.71,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.14,0:10:13.18,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Wait, it doesn't look like \Nit damaged her at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.18,0:10:14.17,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.17,0:10:18.55,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Until just now Halvanhelv didn't \Neven leave a scratch on her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.84,0:10:20.08,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.08,0:10:23.18,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,This seems a little troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.52,0:10:25.36,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,My apologies, Tohka.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.36,0:10:26.95,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'll take you seriously now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.45,0:10:31.44,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'll use my full might to steal Shin from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:33.19,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I won't let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.50,0:10:35.32,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.32,0:10:35.94,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.91,0:10:44.41,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I see, so this...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.72,0:10:53.89,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I guess you stole a portion of my power \Nand the other Spirits' power
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.89,0:10:56.46,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,when you escaped from within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.81,0:10:59.01,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,That's how you're able to use such power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.13,0:11:05.12,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.12,0:11:10.31,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,You are the only Pure Spirit \Nin existence aside from myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.78,0:11:13.45,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,It means you're something like my counterpart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.89,0:11:18.19,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,So perhaps it's only natural that \Nyou can do the same things I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.45,0:11:19.41,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Tohka!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.41,0:11:20.82,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'll lend you power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.49,0:11:54.65,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Yes, despair really doesn't suit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.12,0:11:56.77,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Tohka!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.37,0:11:59.40,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Sandalphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:02.97,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Halvanhelv, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.58,0:12:05.49,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Ein Sof Ohr, Hennet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:08.33,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Leitribish!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.83,0:13:06.99,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Well done, Tohka.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.09,0:13:13.49,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'll have to respond to your \Nnoble feelings and emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.31,0:13:20.07,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Ein.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.93,0:13:36.99,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Tohka?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:40.21,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Tohka is no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.91,0:13:41.71,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:43.88,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Ein, the Angel of nothingness,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:48.26,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,ignores all logic and eliminates everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.17,0:13:50.82,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Tohka is no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.26,0:13:53.22,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,She doesn't exist in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.53,0:13:58.78,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I had no intention of using this Angel,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.23,0:14:02.46,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,since it erases the Spirit Power that \NTohka possessed along with her, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.29,0:14:07.49,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I had no choice if I wanted \Nto be certain I put her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.33,0:14:13.10,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,On the other hand, that also means \NTohka was pressuring me that badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.13,0:14:16.42,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,So please give Tohka your praise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.85,0:14:21.61,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Her feelings toward you were enough \Nfor her to surpass her limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.51,0:14:23.89,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Now, Shin,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.51,0:14:27.51,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,there truly are no others left to interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.98,0:14:33.31,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,The power I have now is plenty \Nto give you a body that never dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.83,0:14:38.15,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,All that's left is restoring to you \Nto Shin completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.61,0:14:41.90,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Metatron!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.15,0:14:47.15,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Camael!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.21,0:14:50.53,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Zadkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:56.90,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Gabriel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.29,0:14:58.33,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.79,0:15:03.02,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Haniel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.09,0:15:10.34,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.09,0:15:15.18,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.61,0:15:20.80,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.80,0:15:22.14,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.14,0:15:24.74,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,It's just difficult \Nwhen you fly around so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.11,0:15:27.23,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Now, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:35.61,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.66,0:15:43.80,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,It would seem I've made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.80,0:15:47.56,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Shido, well done staying alive for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.56,0:15:48.51,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kurumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:50.76,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.76,0:15:52.85,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I thought you were killed by Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.85,0:15:56.01,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,My apologies, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.32,0:16:00.52,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Honestly, I wanted to come \Nracing to your side sooner,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:02.85,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,but it was quite the first for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.85,0:16:06.15,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,so I couldn't get the feeling down right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.15,0:16:07.30,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.30,0:16:09.03,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:11.58,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Yod Aleph, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.58,0:16:13.41,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You're correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:18.91,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,It's my eleventh bullet, one that \Nsends the target into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.42,0:16:21.73,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I'm a clone of Kurumi Tokisaki
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.73,0:16:28.29,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,sent into the future from roughly \Nan hour ago using Yod Aleph.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.34,0:16:30.65,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Zaphkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.90,0:16:46.63,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, I've been entrusted with this future.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.81,0:16:55.09,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I have been sent here \Nto kill you as your final assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.94,0:16:58.17,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Are you being serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.17,0:17:01.24,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Do you think a mere clone can defeat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.24,0:17:07.87,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I can exist for as long as the Spirit Power \Nimbued in Yod Aleph lasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.87,0:17:11.81,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,That's plenty of time to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.21,0:17:20.43,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kurumi! What are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.74,0:17:23.26,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I just told you, did I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.26,0:17:26.26,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I came to defeat Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.26,0:17:28.94,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Oh, and one other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.50,0:17:35.32,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I don't think I was able to forget \Nhow your kiss felt, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.49,0:17:38.20,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.26,0:17:56.51,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.79,0:17:59.49,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.94,0:18:02.10,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.10,0:18:19.66,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Now everything is taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.19,0:18:22.49,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I applaud all of your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.93,0:18:26.41,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,However, all of your resistance was futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.41,0:18:27.31,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Futile?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.66,0:18:30.17,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,It wasn't futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.45,0:18:31.95,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Thanks to everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.07,0:18:36.19,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,and thanks to Tohka fighting for me, \NKurumi made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.91,0:18:41.05,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,And Kurumi made me realize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.59,0:18:47.36,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Origami, Nia, Yoshino, Kotori, Mukuro,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:53.70,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Natsumi, Kaguya, Yuzuru, Miku, and Tohka...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.29,0:18:57.29,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,None of their Angels \Nwere able to work against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:19:02.32,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,But I still have the power of one Angel left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.86,0:19:06.11,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,The power of an Angel \NI've never once used before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.89,0:19:12.53,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kurumi sent her clone into the future \Nto make me realize that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.13,0:19:18.49,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Zaphkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.30,0:19:21.26,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Vav!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.35,0:19:49.83,Main - Italics,Shido,0,0,0,,But what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.59,0:19:53.02,Main - Italics,Shido,0,0,0,,What can I do to stop Mio's actions?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.45,0:19:56.69,Main - Italics,Shido,0,0,0,,At this point in time, \NMio should already be inside of Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.32,0:20:01.69,Main - Italics,Shido,0,0,0,,If I'm not careful, she might \Nrealize I'm trying to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.69,0:20:02.69,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.40,0:20:07.93,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.29,0:20:09.34,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Tohka...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.24,0:20:10.97,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.97,0:20:12.81,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,S-Shido?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.10,0:20:15.44,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Tohka! Tohka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.95,0:20:20.10,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Yes, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.10,0:20:22.57,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.31,0:20:25.78,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Tohka, I...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.97,0:20:30.31,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I had a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.15,0:20:32.18,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.18,0:20:34.78,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah, a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.78,0:20:38.22,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,One where everyone was defeated \Nin the battle against DEM.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.62,0:20:41.42,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I couldn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.09,0:20:44.66,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Even though you tried so hard for me, Tohka...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.45,0:20:46.53,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.63,0:20:50.19,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.19,0:20:52.60,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I'm sure that won't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.55,0:20:54.71,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Tohka...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.36,0:21:00.29,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido, you saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.29,0:21:01.94,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I'm a Spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.94,0:21:04.75,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,and instead of calling me your enemy, \Nyou reached out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.42,0:21:06.82,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,So I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.82,0:21:09.79,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, \NI'll protect you, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.41,0:21:15.41,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Besides, you're the man who's \Nconfronted me and the other Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.41,0:21:18.50,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Like we'd let DEM defeat us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:20.88,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I guess that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.01,0:21:24.63,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.00,0:21:26.78,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tohka.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.78,0:21:30.02,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I think I see what I need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.66,0:21:33.62,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I don't really understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.05,0:21:35.62,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,but that's good then!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.94,0:21:40.77,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Reine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.59,0:21:42.39,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:47.57,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,What is it, Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.98,0:21:48.90,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Reine,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.28,0:21:52.35,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,would you go on a date with me tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.79,0:21:55.05,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs20\shad1\blur1\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HADB0AD&\4c&HADB0AD&\pos(317.333,185.466)}Episode 8
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.79,0:21:55.05,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\an8\b1\fs20\shad1\blur1\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HADB0AD&\4c&HADB0AD&\pos(317.866,280.399)}The One Who Pulled the Trigger
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.05,0:23:40.07,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an3\fnTimes New Roman\bord1\blur3\shad1\fs20\fsp1\pos(604,310)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3D3D3D&\shad0\3a&H60&}Episode 9 "A "Second" Date"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.90,0:23:28.30,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,Shido has been granted one final chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.05,0:23:32.18,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,But how can he conquer Reine and Mio?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.18,0:23:36.01,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,Next time is Episode 9: A "Second" Date.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.01,0:23:39.67,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,Return to the place in her memories once more.
